      <property name="text"><string>This function can create a bootable harddisk image from a profile. Running a game under FreeDOS from a harddisk image can solve some rare problems on games not running in DOSBox directly. (The original profile is not changed in any way. The new harddisk image based profile is created as a copy.)</string></property>
